        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Amybeth McNulty, Lucy Maud Montgomery, Moira Walley-Beckett, Dalila Bela\n- Products: Anne, Anne with an E, Anne of Green Gables, Odd Squad\n- Organizations: CBC, Netflix, PBS Kids\n\nFacts:\n- In 1908, Lucy Maud Montgomery published the novel \"Anne of Green Gables.\"\n- Anne is a Canadian television series based on Lucy Maud Montgomery's 1908 novel \"Anne of Green Gables.\"\n- Anne is titled \"Anne with an E\" on Netflix.\n- Moira Walley-Beckett adapted Anne as the writer and producer.\n- In 2017, Amybeth McNulty starred as Anne Shirley in the CBC/Netflix series Anne.\n- Dalila Bela was born on October 5, 2001.\n- Dalila Bela is a Canadian actress known for playing Agent Olive on the PBS Kids series Odd Squad.\n- Dalila Bela is also known for roles in the \"\" films and for work on the television shows Once Upon a Time and Anne.",
